    "detailed_description": "The game takes place in China. You find yourself on outskirts of Guangzhou, where in the evening you will meet a little girl who lost her mother...<br><br>From this moment on, very strange things will begin to happen to you.<br><br>This is a first-person horror game that is controlled using the keyboard and mouse or joystick. It tells about the fate of 3 people and their stories, who during the game became hostages of a terrible demon. <br><br>You have to look for clues, get out of traps, communicate with characters, save a girl and defeat the ancient evil.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Atmospheric Chinese town.<br></li><li> Unique characters.<br></li><li> Mystical environment.<br></li><li> Responsive controls.<br></li><li> Addictive gameplay.<br></li><li> Good optimization.</li></ul>",
